DB iDB_Comms_ModbusServer
  ROOTID 0
  NUMBER 9000
  INSTANCEOF FB_Comms_ModbusServer
  COMMENT "The state of the Modbus TCP server - the server instance's own working data and the connection settings it listens with. Nothing here is retained: the connection settings come back from their start values on every warm restart, so the listening port and the passive-accept behaviour cannot drift from what the block declares."
  INPUT
  OUTPUT
  MEMBERS
